  "name": "Ursuline Hall",
  "status": "refined",
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "summary": "Brown and grey fieldstone wings flank a square battlemented entrance tower above the sloping front lawn. Stepped gables, pale stone sills, white sash windows, and small gabled dormers articulate the elevations.",
  "style": "collegiate-gothic",
  "evidence": [
    {
